 "caveats": [
  "The ETF book's 11.11% is net of its own 10bp-per-side cost assumption but assumes the capacity line does not bind; the capacity face says at 1,000,000 CNY that assumption holds on 4 of the last 60 sessions, so the marginal yuan is priced at a rate the book cannot currently execute.",
  "The carry lot's income is carry on one contract notional (1,211,600 CNY), not a return on margin; the return-on-capital line divides it by the 8%-vol-budget funding rung.",
  "Two independent carry readings are printed: the tape face's net-of-measured-roll figure (6.361pp) and the basis face's control-drift-adjusted figure (6.599pp). The verdict is decided on the upper one, i.e. the reading most favourable to the carry road.",
  "The 1% ADV capacity line is this repo's own criterion, not an exchange rule: it says how often this capital fits, not what it costs to push.",
  "The step is all-or-nothing: one lot is the smallest whole unit, so the marginal table shows what 129,566 earns in the two continuous books, not a pro-rata carry return."
